    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review Investigative and Prosecutorial Standards in Sexual Offence Cases",
        "additional_details": "We call for a review of the handling of sexual offence cases, including the practices of the CPS and police to ensure fair investigations. [In our view stronger oversight, fair procedures, and strict adherence to evidence-based standards are essential to prevent wrongful accusations and lives being damaged and to protect justice and the presumption of innocence.",
        "background": "We call for a review into the investigative and prosecutorial practices in sexual offence cases to ensure fair evidence standards, proper disclosure, and accountability, protecting the integrity of the justice system for all.",
